00:21:22,872 --> 00:21:25,852
I've been meaning to ask you something for a while now

229
00:21:25,852 --> 00:21:28,172
that boy you brought in here from Ehime

230
00:21:28,172 --> 00:21:30,312
you know the really loud one

231
00:21:30,312 --> 00:21:31,312
Ashito Aoi

232
00:21:31,312 --> 00:21:35,312
do you intend on favoring him

233
00:21:35,312 --> 00:21:36,852
or giving him special treatment?

234
00:21:37,452 --> 00:21:37,672
me?

235
00:21:37,892 --> 00:21:38,712
of course not

236
00:21:38,712 --> 00:21:40,372
you know I'm not the kind of coach

237
00:21:40,372 --> 00:21:41,672
that would do something like that

238
00:21:41,672 --> 00:21:42,672
come on

239
00:21:42,672 --> 00:21:46,392
in that case let me be frank

240
00:21:46,392 --> 00:21:49,032
ever since the tryouts

241
00:21:49,032 --> 00:21:50,692
I've been certain of one thing

242
00:21:50,692 --> 00:21:53,892
unless he improves at a miraculous rate

243
00:21:53,892 --> 00:21:56,512
there's no way he's going pro

244
00:21:56,512 --> 00:22:00,232
even if he puts his all into training

245
00:22:00,232 --> 00:22:02,152
in three years

246
00:22:02,152 --> 00:22:05,672
he still won't be good enough to move up to the A-team

247
00:22:05,672 --> 00:22:10,772
this Ashito Aoi might become your very first failure Fukuda

248
00:22:10,772 --> 00:22:11,572
Boo!

249
00:22:11,772 --> 00:22:13,372
I thought you left

250
00:22:13,372 --> 00:22:16,272
I'm just surprised

251
00:22:16,272 --> 00:22:20,172
and it seems kind of unfair

252
00:22:20,172 --> 00:22:21,312
to say that about a player

253
00:22:21,312 --> 00:22:22,912
who only joined the team today

254
00:22:22,912 --> 00:22:24,052
wouldn't you say?

255
00:22:26,052 --> 00:22:26,612
also

256
00:22:26,612 --> 00:22:29,772
I am a fan of Ashito Aoi

257
00:22:29,772 --> 00:22:31,912
probably his first in the world

258
00:22:31,912 --> 00:22:33,092
wow

259
00:22:46,192 --> 00:22:48,192
you

260
00:24:05,986 --> 00:24:27,886
Next time on Ao Ashi, the first youth match.

